  "prediction": "The meeting discussed the microphone data, specifically the wireless microphones, and how they are being used for recording meetings. It was mentioned that the microphones are being downsampled from 48 kHz to 16 kHz, and that the filter used for downsampling is not clear. The group discussed the possibility of using a different filter or not downsampling the data at all, and also considered the use of a different type of microphone, such as a hand-held microphone that can be passed around to different speakers. The group also discussed the issue of the proprietary connector used by the Sony headsets and the possibility of customizing the headsets or using a different type of headset.",
